{"id":200492283760346,"type":"artist","name":"Venetian Snares","artist":null,"year":1975,"weight":34,"info":{"tags":["breakcore","idm","electronic","experimental","electronica"],"country":"CA","begin":"1975-01-11","kind":"Person","similar":["Last Step","Doormouse","Xanopticon","Ruby My Dear","Squarepusher","Shitmat","Acrnym","Dev/Null","Datach'i","Kid606"],"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Aaron_Funk.jpg?width=500","bio":"Venetian Snares es el nombre artístico de Aaron Funk (nacido el 17 de enero de 1975), un productor e intérprete de música electrónica de Winnipeg, Manitoba, Canadá. Su fama se debe principalmente a que compone IDM, breakcore y glitchcore a menudo en compases poco usuales, además de sus grabaciones prolíficas, con discos editados en los siguientes sellos discográficos: History of the Future, Isolate/DySLeXiC ResPonSe, Addict, Zod, Distort, Sublight, Low-Res, Planet Mu e Hymen."},"works":[{"id":114395120939046,"type":"album","name":"Higgins Ultra Low Track Glue Funk Hits 1972-2006","artist":"Venetian Snares","year":1972,"weight":5,"yt":"dPX5yduFKyU","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":91130115313445,"name":"RYM Top — Electronic — Hardcore [EDM]","rank":161,"scaruffi":null},{"id":94484665950441,"name":"RYM Top — Dance — Breakcore","rank":52,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":68397039594521,"type":"album","name":"Spells 1","artist":"Venetian Snares","year":1998,"weight":11,"yt":"J1TQicFTuiY","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":25820424078047,"name":"RYM Top — Electronic — Drill and Bass","rank":70,"scaruffi":null},{"id":53484321061719,"name":"RYM Top — Electronic — Tracker Music","rank":31,"scaruffi":null},{"id":94484665950441,"name":"RYM Top — Dance — Breakcore","rank":200,"scaruffi":null},{"id":154518486983933,"name":"RYM Top — Electronic — Sequencer & Tracker","rank":61,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":5}},{"id":83458750592504,"type":"album","name":"Subvert!","artist":"